<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Ghiyath al-Din Pir Ali</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">d. 1383</span></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Ghiyath al-Din Pir Ali was the last ruler of the Kart dynasty of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/herat">Herat</a>, reigning from 1370. He submitted to <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/timur">Timur</a>, who took Herat in 1381 and deposed him. After a revolt in Herat in 1383 he and his family were put to death, ending the dynasty.</p></div>
